Excuse me.

48
00:03:01,771 --> 00:03:07,404
Is this the food waste reduction café?

49
00:03:07,427 --> 00:03:09,710
Welcome!

50
00:03:09,733 --> 00:03:13,566
Yes, this is the food waste reduction café!

51
00:03:13,589 --> 00:03:16,523
