81
00:04:57,340 --> 00:05:01,274
That'll be 800 yen for the cookies, chocolates, and bread.

82
00:05:01,297 --> 00:05:06,737
I'll pay with a 1,000-yen bill. Here you go.

83
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:09,647
Your change is 200 yen.

84
00:05:09,671 --> 00:05:12,671
I'll put them in your reusable bag.

85
00:05:12,694 --> 00:05:14,294
Thank you!

86
00:05:14,317 --> 00:05:17,895
Your change is 200 yen.

87
00:05:17,918 --> 00:05:21,724
Thank you for helping reduce food waste!

88
00:05:21,748 --> 00:05:25,163
Enjoy your treats and help the planet!

89
00:05:25,186 --> 00:05:27,586
Come back and see us again!

