171
00:10:16,291 --> 00:10:20,491
Yes, you can get a tax exemption by showing your passport.

172
00:10:20,514 --> 00:10:23,186
Here's my passport.

173
00:10:23,209 --> 00:10:25,142
Thank you!

174
00:10:25,165 --> 00:10:27,899
I'll give you a discount and make it 5,000 yen.

175
00:10:27,922 --> 00:10:30,939
I'll pay with a credit card.

176
00:10:30,962 --> 00:10:33,054
I'll take your card.

177
00:10:33,078 --> 00:10:35,878
