209
00:12:03,285 --> 00:12:04,729
Yes.

210
00:12:04,752 --> 00:12:08,552
There are free water refill stations available.

211
00:12:08,575 --> 00:12:11,511
This will help reduce plastic bottle use.

212
00:12:11,534 --> 00:12:14,968
It helps cut down on plastic waste.

213
00:12:14,992 --> 00:12:17,434
How much is it?

214
00:12:17,457 --> 00:12:21,657
It's 2,200 yen including tax.

215
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:24,913
I'll take this white reusable bottle.

216
00:12:24,936 --> 00:12:26,870
Thank you!

217
00:12:26,893 --> 00:12:30,126
Can you put it in a box?

218
00:12:30,149 --> 00:12:34,282
Let me put it in a box and tie a ribbon for you.

219
00:12:34,305 --> 00:12:36,924
Please wrap it as a gift.

220
00:12:36,948 --> 00:12:38,481
Yes.

221
00:12:38,504 --> 00:12:41,105
I'll wrap it beautifully for you.

222
00:12:41,129 --> 00:12:43,929
I'll pay with a credit card.

223
00:12:43,951 --> 00:12:48,151
Please tap your card on this terminal.

224
00:12:48,174 --> 00:12:49,608
Yes.

225
00:12:49,631 --> 00:12:51,397
I'll tap it now.

226
00:12:51,421 --> 00:12:54,554
Here's your receipt and card back.

227
00:12:54,577 --> 00:12:58,144
Let me put your reusable bottle in a bag for you.

228
00:12:58,167 --> 00:13:00,016
Thank you!

229
