253
00:14:28,041 --> 00:14:31,374
Prepared foods at department store basements are also cheap.

254
00:14:31,397 --> 00:14:35,364
There are so many delicious options!

255
00:14:35,387 --> 00:14:39,154
The croquettes at the local shopping street are also amazing.

256
00:14:39,177 --> 00:14:42,710
Can I buy one for just 100 yen?

257
00:14:42,733 --> 00:14:47,133
Yes, you can get one for just 100 yen!

258
00:14:47,156 --> 00:14:51,004
I’ll look for affordable and tasty spots!

259
00:14:51,027 --> 00:14:55,126
Let’s enjoy some great deals on food together!

260
00:14:55,150 --> 00:14:58,008
