261
00:14:58,032 --> 00:15:02,504
Yes, let’s meet at the supermarket at 7 PM!

262
00:15:02,527 --> 00:15:06,060
I’ll look for half-price bento boxes!

263
00:15:06,083 --> 00:15:09,017
